            "content_html": "<div class=\"WeProfessionals\">\n    <div class=\"WeProfessionalTitle\">\n        <h2>sampling</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"WeProfessionalPera\">\n        <p>Many of our professional partners like to let families “try before they buy”.  They keep a sample or two on hand for parent trialing (thoroughly sterilizing between uses, of course).</p>\n        <p>We’ll happily keep you supplied with samples for this purpose as long as mōmi remains an active tool in your toolkit for helping babies and the people who feed them.</p>\n        <p>When you need to refresh your samples just email <a href=\"mailto:partners@momi.baby.\">partners@momi.baby.</a></p>\n    </div>\n\n</div>",
            "show_rating": false,
            "rating": 4
          }
        },
        "quote_JCnFzC": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "class_name1": "",
            "class_name_image": "",
            "logo_width": 100,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_url_Mobile": "",
            "heading_title": "",
            "heading_title_mobile": "",
            "author": "",
            "authorpro": "",
            "content": "",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"WeProfessionals\">\n    <div class=\"WeProfessionalTitle\">\n        <h2>product discounts</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"WeProfessionalPera\">\n        <p>We know that mōmi is a significant investment for many families.  As a way of supporting our professional partners who use mōmi in their work with families, we make our very best product discounts to families available exclusively through professionals.</p>\n        <p>We provide discount coupons and codes you can share with your families, good for 20% off their first mōmi purchase.  You can use these with in-person and virtual consults alike.</p>\n        <p>Email partners@momi.baby to request discount codes for use with your families.</p>\n    </div>\n\n</div>",
            "show_rating": false,
            "rating": 4
          }
        },
        "quote_NNPkXJ": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "class_name1": "",
            "class_name_image": "",
            "logo_width": 100,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_url_Mobile": "",
            "heading_title": "",
            "heading_title_mobile": "",
            "author": "",
            "authorpro": "",
            "content": "",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"WeProfessionals\">\n    <div class=\"WeProfessionalTitle\">\n        <h2>client referral network</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"WeProfessionalPera\">\n        <p>We’ve learned that parents have a much higher success rate with mōmi when supported by a professional.  We are building a database of professionals experienced in working with mōmi to whom we can refer parents seeking help.</p>\n        <p>Contact partners@momi.baby if you’d like to be included in the upcoming directory.  The directory will include professionals who offer in-person consults and also those offering virtual visits, so geography is not a limitation.</p>\n    </div>\n\n</div>",
            "show_rating": false,
            "rating": 4
          }
        },
        "quote_3W9t8J": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "class_name1": "",
            "class_name_image": "",
            "logo_width": 100,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_url_Mobile": "",
